Write here. This is markdown, so the usual things work: **bold**, _italic_,
[links](https://example.com), lists, `inline code` and fenced blocks.

Because the file is `.svx` rather than `.md`, Svelte works too — you can import a
component at the top and drop it mid-paragraph when a post needs a figure or
something interactive.
